.task-board/.resources/TASK-260720-poa3ze/TASK-260720-poa3ze_spawn-log_-analyst--researcher--codex-.log:13971:- a non-standard package containing `//go:cgo_import_dynamic _ _ "libReviewerProbe.dylib"` listed `GoFiles:["main.go"]` with empty `CgoFiles`, `SFiles`, and `SysoFiles`, yet the fixed internal-link build succeeded and `otool -L` showed `libReviewerProbe.dylib`; the new active-`GoFiles` byte scan rejects it before `go build`;
