@@ -0,0 +1,48 @@
+# TASK-260720-3ag6pi acceptance and negative-vector coverage
+
+All names below are executable cases in the integrated `curator-spec`
+`1.0.0-rc.4` candidate. `make validate` passed with the validator's exact
+35-schema, 129-schema-case, and 189-manifest-entry inventories; the Go
+generator tests pin the named vector inventories and generated bytes.
+
+## Story acceptance criteria
+
+| STORY-260720-35dck7 acceptance criterion | Passing executable evidence |
+|---|---|
+| A new schema version validates the agreed build declarations. | Schema cases `agent-skill-v6/valid.json`, `csk-skill-v6/valid.json`, `build-receipt-v1/valid.json`, `install-marker-v2/valid.json`, and `conformance-claim-v2/valid.json`; invalid v6 structural cases prove the surface is closed. |
+| Go driver semantics and install ordering are normative. | Build-driver cases `fixed-environment-and-five-direct-argv-forms`, `valid-standard-library-only-main`, and `valid-vendor-only-main-with-transitive-embed`; lifecycle cases `all-source-and-trust-gates-before-build`, `provider-first-and-lexical-command-order`, `deterministic-lock-order`, and `deterministic-target-order-and-consumer-last`. |
+| Build sources are excluded from agent context. | Positive case `build-root-excluded-from-agent-context`; rejection cases `build-root-content-in-context` and `marker-embed-build-source-regression`; `protected-cache-hit` and `compiler-free-dry-run-miss` both contain no source-aware Go command. |
+| Dry-run and audit-before-build are explicit. | Lifecycle `all-source-and-trust-gates-before-build` puts source audit, registry, attestation, and revocation gates before toolchain/cache/build; `compiled-cache-miss-is-read-only`, `project-upgrade`, and `global-upgrade` prohibit persistent effects and source-aware build commands. |
+| Compatibility and security impact are recorded. | Byte-identical legacy schemas/cases for agent-skill and csk-skill v1-v5, install-marker-v1, and conformance-claim-v1; security cases `self-consistent-forged-receipt-outside-protected-state`, `cgo-import-dynamic`, `external-link-required`, and receipt schema cases `invalid-self-asserted-trusted.json`, `invalid-self-asserted-provenance.json`, and `invalid-self-asserted-manager-created.json`. The normative impact is recorded in `COMPATIBILITY.md`, `SECURITY.md`, and decision 0004. |
+| Vectors cover valid builds and all key rejection cases. | Seven `positive_cases`, 75 `rejection_cases`, ten `build_source_cases`, twelve `toolchain_cases`, and the compiled lifecycle groups all passed exact inventory validation. The detailed rejection-cluster mapping follows. |
+| Specification validation and deterministic regeneration pass. | `make validate`, two clean `make regenerate` runs, `make regenerate-check`, and `make release-check VERSION=1.0.0-rc.4` passed. Both regenerated 190-file trees have aggregate SHA-256 `41aa37774478c26377455877ee79ef74f8cb5cf5562ea5b1501e5c94fe9c1fa0`. |
+
+## Minimum rejection clusters
+
+| Rejection cluster | Passing schema cases or vectors |
+|---|---|
+| Structural manifest | `schema-5-build-command`, `unknown-driver`, `forbidden-args`, `forbidden-env`, `forbidden-output`, `forbidden-toolchain`, `forbidden-hooks`, `mixed-script-build-shape`; agent-skill-v6 and csk-skill-v6 cases `invalid-build-missing-driver.json`, `invalid-build-missing-source-dir.json`, `invalid-build-unsupported-driver.json`, `invalid-build-mixed-script.json`, `invalid-build-mixed-system.json`, `invalid-build-args.json`, `invalid-build-env.json`, `invalid-build-flags.json`, `invalid-build-hooks.json`, `invalid-build-output.json`, `invalid-build-scripts.json`, `invalid-build-tags.json`, and `invalid-build-toolchain.json`. |
+| Build-root, source, and context paths | `missing-build-roots`, `missing-build-root-directory`, `unused-build-root`, `overlapping-build-roots`, `runtime-overlapping-build-root`, `root-build-root`, `build-root-symlink`, `build-root-special-file`, `root-source-dir`, `escaped-source-dir`, `source-outside-root`, `source-link`, `source-special-file`, `source-not-directory`, `missing-root-go-mod`, `nested-module`, `non-main-package`, `multiple-packages`, and `build-root-content-in-context`. |
